{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわりばし(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が自撮り中、\n中田のHTC Jを取られ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん「可愛い写真撮ってあげる〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/28/8150093/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんお誕生日おめでとう(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日過ぎちゃったけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんごぱーんry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バトンで肉離れするの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n太もも肉離れとかしたときは\n逆立ちしてブリッジ、みたいなやつ！\nハンドスプリングのゆっくり？みたいなやつ！\nを何回かやってたら気づいたら痛くなってたんだよね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインどのくらいチョコもらってた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n女子校のバレンタインはやばいよw\n友チョコとかの山！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n6時に起きようとアラームセットしてても\n3時から5時の間に\n2回起きるんだよね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも\nアラームで起きたと勘違いして\nちゃんと目覚めて\nてきぱき準備し始めて\nそこで気づくんだよね(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももったいないから\n2度寝しようと思っても\n6時に起きれるか不安で寝れない(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無駄に寝不足なるよおーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで最近気になりだしたのが\n夢占いみたいなやつ｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま寝れないのとは\n関係ないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいよね！\nいろいろわかるんだよ(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかっちゃうんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/28/8150093/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ、みなさん\n今日はなんの夢を見たか\n起きたら報告ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/28/8150093/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}